<section>
  <div class="wrap two two--top">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Every family, every day</p>
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><strong>Doors open at 8:00.</strong> Classes run from 8:30 to 15:20. Nursery and Kindergarten finish at 15:15.</li>
        <li><strong>Off sick or away?</strong> Tell us by 8:00 that morning. For travel, give us two weeks' notice so the teachers can prepare work.</li>
        <li><strong>Pick-up</strong> is only by the people named on your enrollment form.</li>
        <li><strong>Pack</strong> a water bottle every day, and closed-toe shoes for PE and trips. Early Years: spare clothes, plus nappies and wipes if needed.</li>
        <li><strong>No uniform.</strong> Children come in their own clothes.</li>
        <li><strong>Phones</strong> stay at the front desk until the end of the day.</li>
        <li><strong>Signs of illness</strong> such as fever, cough, rash, red eyes, vomiting or diarrhoea: tell us straight away.</li>
        <li><strong>News</strong> comes through Google Classroom, the weekly newsletter and your class Zalo group.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>The full handbook</h3>
      <p>The handbook covers the rest: health and medicine, the bus, trips and devices.</p>
      <p>Need a copy? Ask the office and we will send one.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--small" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Family%20handbook">Ask for the handbook</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

